# The kit is generated by planning/build-kit.js in the source project.
# Everything the kit needs is committed; only local noise is ignored.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
node_modules/
*.log

# iCloud Drive syncs the source project's folder and resolves a write collision by keeping both
# copies — "START-HERE 2.md", "LICENSE 3", "stays 2". They are stale text under a name nothing
# generates. The build sweeps them and kit-verify fails on them; this keeps them out of git too.
* [0-9].*
* [0-9]
* [0-9][0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9]
